				"name": "Thin layer",
				"keywords": "ownership, upstream, interface, documentation, release",
				"datePublished": "2026-10-13T10:34:29+09:00",
				"dateModified": "2026-10-13T10:34:29+09:00",
				"description": "When upstream deletes the thin layer you hesitated to own, the rule against owning it stops being a veto but keeps its prohibition: owning the interface does not authorize owning the engine."
			}
		},
		{
			"@type": "ListItem",
			"position": 133,
			"item": {
				"@type": "BlogPosting",
				"@id": "https://aionsclubs.org/bricks/20261013-prompt-turn.html#brick",
