				"name": "Pane list",
				"keywords": "gate, permission, privacy, consent",
				"datePublished": "2026-10-13T01:37:08+09:00",
				"dateModified": "2026-10-13T01:37:08+09:00",
				"description": "The gate's check that it had left his panes alone would itself have read them, so it was stopped after 22 seconds and he was asked; whether it may look is his question, not the gate's."
			}
		},
		{
			"@type": "ListItem",
			"position": 135,
			"item": {
				"@type": "BlogPosting",
