				"name": "0.35.0",
				"keywords": "release, exception, gate, honesty",
				"datePublished": "2026-10-12T07:38:38+09:00",
				"dateModified": "2026-10-12T07:38:38+09:00",
				"description": "Both of his subtractions shipped in the release note as explicit unmeasured exceptions, never as passes; the operator's removal and the gate's refusal became one public sentence."
			}
		},
		{
			"@type": "ListItem",
			"position": 141,
			"item": {
				"@type": "BlogPosting",
				"@id": "https://aionsclubs.org/bricks/20261012-skip.html#brick",
