				"name": "Skip",
				"keywords": "gate, skip, subtraction, honesty",
				"datePublished": "2026-10-12T04:35:22+09:00",
				"dateModified": "2026-10-12T04:35:22+09:00",
				"description": "Asked to choose, he removed something; the gate recorded his removal as a skip and refused to call it green. What looks like disagreement is one fact written from two sides."
			}
		},
		{
			"@type": "ListItem",
			"position": 142,
			"item": {
				"@type": "BlogPosting",
				"@id": "https://aionsclubs.org/bricks/20261012-woke.html#brick",
