				"name": "Round trip",
				"keywords": "latency, memory, store, measurement",
				"datePublished": "2026-10-11T19:36:19+09:00",
				"dateModified": "2026-10-11T19:36:19+09:00",
				"description": "A fresh pi-durable round trip took 21 seconds and the piled-up coordinator's review 1086, two numbers not to be compared; all the evening measured is that slowness did not live in the fresh store."
			}
		},
		{
			"@type": "ListItem",
			"position": 145,
			"item": {
				"@type": "BlogPosting",
				"@id": "https://aionsclubs.org/bricks/20261011-outsider.html#brick",
