				"name": "Three reds",
				"keywords": "gate, failure, grant, erratum",
				"datePublished": "2026-10-08T01:34:34+09:00",
				"dateModified": "2026-10-08T01:34:34+09:00",
				"description": "Three reds, none in the harness the gate exists to prove, each answered by a narrower grant; and a reviewer retired a sentence of its own verdict, unasked, 83 seconds later."
			}
		},
		{
			"@type": "ListItem",
			"position": 164,
			"item": {
				"@type": "BlogPosting",
