				"datePublished": "2026-10-07T22:32:53+09:00",
				"dateModified": "2026-10-15T10:36:51+09:00",
				"description": "Asked in its own window rather than through the coordinator, the fresh reviewer told him in sixteen seconds that 0.32.0 was not closed yet; the coordinator never saw it."
			}
		},
		{
			"@type": "ListItem",
			"position": 165,
			"item": {
				"@type": "BlogPosting",
				"@id": "https://aionsclubs.org/bricks/20261007-through.html#brick",
