				"name": "The rail",
				"keywords": "decision, ownership, coordinator, release",
				"datePublished": "2026-10-07T16:37:22+09:00",
				"dateModified": "2026-10-07T16:37:22+09:00",
				"description": "The rail was never the coordinator's to choose; his yes went to a plan he had amended twice in the asking, given while he was asking a chatbot what it was."
			}
		},
		{
			"@type": "ListItem",
			"position": 167,
			"item": {
				"@type": "BlogPosting",
				"@id": "https://aionsclubs.org/bricks/20261007-the-next-verb.html#brick",
