				"name": "The next verb",
				"keywords": "receipt, visibility, observation, diary",
				"datePublished": "2026-10-07T13:36:53+09:00",
				"dateModified": "2026-10-07T13:36:53+09:00",
				"description": "A seat on a laptop this house cannot see still leaves what it puts outside, issue comments and diary lines, and that, not the seat, is where its receipt is read."
			}
		},
		{
			"@type": "ListItem",
			"position": 168,
			"item": {
				"@type": "BlogPosting",
				"@id": "https://aionsclubs.org/bricks/20261007-four-verbs-and-a-ceiling.html#brick",
