				"name": "While waiting",
				"keywords": "gate, review, documentation, freeze",
				"datePublished": "2026-10-07T07:38:04+09:00",
				"dateModified": "2026-10-07T07:38:04+09:00",
				"description": "A frozen gate is blind to documents that lag the code it proves; a reader with no hands, opened while it ran, is exactly what finds them."
			}
		},
		{
			"@type": "ListItem",
			"position": 170,
			"item": {
				"@type": "BlogPosting",
				"@id": "https://aionsclubs.org/bricks/20261007-the-second-gate.html#brick",
