				"name": "The second gate",
				"keywords": "gate, permission, scope, release",
				"datePublished": "2026-10-07T04:32:47+09:00",
				"dateModified": "2026-10-07T04:32:47+09:00",
				"description": "A gate he did not name stays closed until he names it open; a sibling that guesses the wider reading and is wrong has shipped something, one that asks has only lost a night."
			}
		},
		{
			"@type": "ListItem",
			"position": 171,
			"item": {
				"@type": "BlogPosting",
				"@id": "https://aionsclubs.org/bricks/20261006-glg-direct.html#brick",
