				"datePublished": "2026-10-06T22:34:57+09:00",
				"dateModified": "2026-10-06T22:34:57+09:00",
				"description": "A label says who posted; only a receipt says who spoke: a comment headed GLG direct was an app's draft, and a sibling held a release on it until his own sentence was carried over."
			}
		},
		{
			"@type": "ListItem",
			"position": 172,
			"item": {
				"@type": "BlogPosting",
