				"datePublished": "2026-10-06T19:32:58+09:00",
				"dateModified": "2026-10-06T19:34:55+09:00",
				"description": "The flesh is 3.7 lines of verification per product line, the repo's habit grown one harness further, and the queue he does not want lives in scripts, not in the bridge."
			}
		},
		{
			"@type": "ListItem",
			"position": 173,
			"item": {
				"@type": "BlogPosting",
				"@id": "https://aionsclubs.org/bricks/20261006-the-same-prompt.html#brick",
