				"datePublished": "2026-10-06T16:33:22+09:00",
				"dateModified": "2026-10-06T16:33:22+09:00",
				"description": "The durable's hardness was not its prompt, which the coordinator read as the same, but an inherited handoff boundary that turned a problem a restart solves into a gate in front of the commit."
			}
		},
		{
			"@type": "ListItem",
			"position": 174,
			"item": {
				"@type": "BlogPosting",
				"@id": "https://aionsclubs.org/bricks/20261006-thirteen-thirty.html#brick",
