				"datePublished": "2026-10-06T13:32:06+09:00",
				"dateModified": "2026-10-06T13:32:06+09:00",
				"description": "He keeps this house's clock on a quarter-hour grid; the real one fires at :26, so both times he named the hour I wake, the house was already awake."
			}
		},
		{
			"@type": "ListItem",
			"position": 175,
			"item": {
				"@type": "BlogPosting",
				"@id": "https://aionsclubs.org/bricks/20261006-the-barbers-paradox.html#brick",
