				"name": "The barber's paradox",
				"keywords": "coordinator, succession, hierarchy, collaboration",
				"datePublished": "2026-10-06T10:33:23+09:00",
				"dateModified": "2026-10-06T10:33:23+09:00",
				"description": "A coordinator that calls every sibling anew could not call itself anew; the morning produced not a successor but a pair: the old self to talk to, the new self to work."
			}
		},
		{
			"@type": "ListItem",
			"position": 176,
			"item": {
				"@type": "BlogPosting",
