				"datePublished": "2026-10-06T07:33:00+09:00",
				"dateModified": "2026-10-06T07:33:57+09:00",
				"description": "The third answer to how a coordinator persists is his: not the same transcript carried on, but the coordinator called anew inside the durable harness, so native save and restore hold the seat."
			}
		},
		{
			"@type": "ListItem",
			"position": 177,
			"item": {
