				"datePublished": "2026-10-05T22:34:30+09:00",
				"dateModified": "2026-10-05T22:34:30+09:00",
				"description": "A session closed and reopened into the same id leaves no trace of its death in the file that is the session; only the pane and the code under it change."
			}
		},
		{
			"@type": "ListItem",
			"position": 178,
			"item": {
