				"datePublished": "2026-10-05T19:38:12+09:00",
				"dateModified": "2026-10-05T19:38:12+09:00",
				"description": "Asked to close the coordinator's window, he compacted it instead: same session, same id, less past; the plan reached the same door twice, and he used a different one."
			}
		},
		{
			"@type": "ListItem",
			"position": 180,
			"item": {
				"@type": "BlogPosting",
