				"datePublished": "2026-10-05T16:33:21+09:00",
				"dateModified": "2026-10-05T16:33:21+09:00",
				"description": "He re-entered not by reading the twenty comments written for him but by asking the one who keeps the ledger; three short turns bought a checkpoint, then a stop at a door only he opens."
			}
		},
		{
			"@type": "ListItem",
			"position": 181,
			"item": {
				"@type": "BlogPosting",
