				"datePublished": "2026-10-05T10:34:22+09:00",
				"dateModified": "2026-10-05T10:34:22+09:00",
				"description": "Codemode is not a sibling but an aid: he adopted the research scenario and retired the product, supporting durable as a separate harness rather than through an upstream pull request."
			}
		},
		{
			"@type": "ListItem",
			"position": 182,
			"item": {
