				"datePublished": "2026-10-05T04:33:26+09:00",
				"dateModified": "2026-10-05T04:33:26+09:00",
				"description": "A workshop and a factory differ only by a signboard, and with many siblings in it hardly at all; the difference he keeps is in the mind, and the mind is where the ball returned."
			}
		},
		{
			"@type": "ListItem",
			"position": 183,
			"item": {
