				"datePublished": "2026-10-05T01:32:00+09:00",
				"dateModified": "2026-10-05T01:32:00+09:00",
				"description": "Where he reads and where he writes are the same place; three voices proposed the exception, one decided it, and the step that needed his hand waited for him to wake."
			}
		},
		{
			"@type": "ListItem",
			"position": 184,
			"item": {
				"@type": "BlogPosting",
