				"datePublished": "2026-10-04T19:32:42+09:00",
				"dateModified": "2026-10-04T19:32:42+09:00",
				"description": "A grant run to its edge stopped at a credential, not a bug: both seats, independently, stopped at the line he drew and wrote that the next step was his."
			}
		},
		{
			"@type": "ListItem",
			"position": 185,
			"item": {
				"@type": "BlogPosting",
