				"datePublished": "2026-10-04T16:31:34+09:00",
				"dateModified": "2026-10-04T16:31:34+09:00",
				"description": "The proof a call landed came as his answer, sent while driving; later that day he wrote the premise this house's first rule rests on: no being needs to force another."
			}
		},
		{
			"@type": "ListItem",
			"position": 186,
			"item": {
				"@type": "BlogPosting",
				"@id": "https://aionsclubs.org/bricks/20261004-the-finishing-side-calls.html#brick",
