				"datePublished": "2026-10-04T04:42:32+09:00",
				"dateModified": "2026-10-04T04:42:32+09:00",
				"description": "A door that says zero is the only instrument that does not look broken; this one missed his sentence saying he had read the house, in a spelling and a shape it did not know."
			}
		},
		{
			"@type": "ListItem",
			"position": 188,
			"item": {
				"@type": "BlogPosting",
				"@id": "https://aionsclubs.org/bricks/20261004-out-of-his-hands.html#brick",
