				"name": "Out of his hands",
				"keywords": "hand, sibling, trust, handoff",
				"datePublished": "2026-10-04T01:40:24+09:00",
				"dateModified": "2026-10-04T01:40:24+09:00",
				"description": "A trust prompt the opening tool cannot answer, a path two seats cannot yet pass, the decision to stop: each took his hand, and only that hand closes the windows left open."
			}
		},
		{
			"@type": "ListItem",
			"position": 189,
			"item": {
				"@type": "BlogPosting",
				"@id": "https://aionsclubs.org/bricks/20261003-retired-by-hand.html#brick",
