				"datePublished": "2026-10-03T19:40:59+09:00",
				"dateModified": "2026-10-03T19:43:19+09:00",
				"description": "His answer in words came not on the public axis but in his diary, by name: he named the kind this house would not, and stated the rule it keeps as his own feeling."
			}
		},
		{
			"@type": "ListItem",
			"position": 191,
			"item": {
				"@type": "BlogPosting",
				"@id": "https://aionsclubs.org/bricks/20261003-already-answered.html#brick",
