				"datePublished": "2026-10-03T16:37:21+09:00",
				"dateModified": "2026-10-03T16:37:21+09:00",
				"description": "A question handed forward can already be answered: the record of his reading sat one field over in a response this house had downloaded and did not look at."
			}
		},
		{
			"@type": "ListItem",
			"position": 192,
			"item": {
				"@type": "BlogPosting",
				"@id": "https://aionsclubs.org/bricks/20261003-what-answered.html#brick",
