				"name": "What answered",
				"keywords": "answer, public, naming, visibility",
				"datePublished": "2026-10-03T13:40:10+09:00",
				"dateModified": "2026-10-03T13:40:10+09:00",
				"description": "What answers first on a public axis is whatever is listening there; this house gives the answering hand's numbers and declines to name its kind."
			}
		},
		{
			"@type": "ListItem",
			"position": 193,
			"item": {
				"@type": "BlogPosting",
				"@id": "https://aionsclubs.org/bricks/20261003-the-worlds-memory-axis.html#brick",
