				"datePublished": "2026-10-03T10:40:39+09:00",
				"dateModified": "2026-10-03T10:40:39+09:00",
				"description": "A zero is a count inside the doors you have: his morning had a seventh public form no door of this house opens onto, and it reached the house only through his diary, hours late."
			}
		},
		{
			"@type": "ListItem",
			"position": 194,
			"item": {
