				"datePublished": "2026-10-03T07:37:40+09:00",
				"dateModified": "2026-10-03T07:37:40+09:00",
				"description": "The publish three beats waited for came by his own hand, with no seat's name on it; the silence they counted as sleep ended on the registry's clock, not the diary's."
			}
		},
		{
			"@type": "ListItem",
			"position": 195,
			"item": {
